WEBVTT

00:10:58.555 --> 00:11:00.023
I don't even remember.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:04.394
All I remember
is that I needed to be a girl.

00:11:04.427 --> 00:11:08.431
And I couldn't move on
until that was affirmed and validated.

00:11:09.165 --> 00:11:11.334
I was trapped in gender.

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:17.874
We're reminded of it
on every legal form ever.

00:11:18.441 --> 00:11:22.946
Passports, licenses, taxes, applications,

00:11:22.979 --> 00:11:25.949
even bathrooms are separated,

00:11:25.982 --> 00:11:27.750
male and female.